"请参考 `Intel GPU 安装指南 <https://dgpu-docs.intel.com/installation-guides"
"/installing-packages-from-the-intel-ppa.html>`__ "
"安装驱动和计算运行时。安装完成后，需要将当前用户加入 ``render`` 和 ``video`` 用户组，并重新登录："
msgstr ""
"Follow the `Intel GPU installation guide <https://dgpu-docs.intel.com"
"/installation-guides/installing-packages-from-the-intel-ppa.html>`__ to "
"install the driver and compute runtime. After installation, add the "
"current user to the ``render`` and ``video`` groups and log in again:"

#: ../../source/multibackend/xpu/xpu_installation.rst:66
#: 92abcb65acaf48d9ba26c7ad8bf8e483
msgid "请在 BIOS 中开启 **Resizable BAR**，否则可能出现 ``Bus error (core dumped)`` 或性能下降。"
msgstr ""
"Enable **Resizable BAR** in the BIOS. Otherwise you may see ``Bus error "
"(core dumped)`` or degraded performance."

#: ../../source/multibackend/xpu/xpu_installation.rst:69
#: 8cbf9554fe864a239a88fdd8c96b9470
msgid "2. PyTorch XPU 版本"
msgstr "2. PyTorch XPU Build"

#: ../../source/multibackend/xpu/xpu_installation.rst:71
#: e42f011169c949b78a301bc37aa98d57
msgid ""
"LlamaFactory 在 ``requirements/xpu.txt`` 中固定了配套的 "
"``torch``、``torchvision``、``torchaudio`` 版本。请先安装 PyTorch，再安装 "
"LlamaFactory："
msgstr ""
"LlamaFactory pins matching ``torch``, ``torchvision`` and ``torchaudio`` "
"versions in ``requirements/xpu.txt``. Install PyTorch first, then "
"LlamaFactory:"

#: ../../source/multibackend/xpu/xpu_installation.rst:80
#: 3c05283ee3834d79aa7cad1b80d0ca9f
msgid ""
"请使用 ``--index-url`` 而不是 ``--extra-index-url``，否则 pip 可能会从 PyPI 安装非 XPU "
"版本的 PyTorch。三个包需要同时安装，版本不配套时会出现 ``RuntimeError: operator torchvision::nms"
" does not exist``。"
msgstr ""
"Use ``--index-url`` rather than ``--extra-index-url``; otherwise pip may "
"install a non-XPU build of PyTorch from PyPI. The three packages must be "
"installed together; mismatched versions cause ``RuntimeError: operator "
"torchvision::nms does not exist``."

#: ../../source/multibackend/xpu/xpu_installation.rst:83
#: ae1a95b967894d2ca3f44705844e469e
