msgid "DeepSpeed"
msgstr "DeepSpeed"

#: ../../source/multibackend/xpu/xpu_installation.rst:115
#: 686690b2e8f34ea9897e17bad440a58f
msgid ""
"需要 ``deepspeed>=0.18.7``：``DS_BUILD_OPS=0 pip install "
"\"deepspeed>=0.18.7\"``。更早的版本在 XPU 上会因 ``ImportError: cannot import name "
"'DpcppBuildExtension'`` 失败，``requirements/deepspeed.txt`` "
"中的版本范围目前也包含这些版本。"
msgstr ""
"Requires ``deepspeed>=0.18.7``: ``DS_BUILD_OPS=0 pip install "
"\"deepspeed>=0.18.7\"``. Earlier versions fail on XPU with ``ImportError:"
" cannot import name 'DpcppBuildExtension'``, and the version range in "
"``requirements/deepspeed.txt`` currently still includes them."

#: ../../source/multibackend/xpu/xpu_installation.rst:116
#: c2c7c691354645ab8742a219ea0d9bae
msgid "bitsandbytes"
msgstr "bitsandbytes"

