msgstr ""
"Requires Intel's offline compiler ``ocloc``. Install an ``intel-ocloc`` "
"version that matches the compute runtime."

#: ../../source/multibackend/xpu/xpu_installation.rst:129
#: 54c68653712649bfbb060f430494ff24
msgid "方式二：Docker 本地构建"
msgstr "Method 2: Docker Local Build"

#: ../../source/multibackend/xpu/xpu_installation.rst:132
#: 5791180bce544402a0d6ef0c28a2b2f0
msgid "请确保宿主机已安装内核驱动。目前 XPU 镜像需要在本地构建，Docker Hub 上暂无预构建镜像。"
msgstr ""
"Make sure the kernel driver is installed on the host. The XPU image "
"currently has to be built locally; there is no prebuilt image on Docker "
"Hub."

#: ../../source/multibackend/xpu/xpu_installation.rst:134
#: 75e4bad1fc984b42889ede54175dee66
msgid ""
"镜像基于 Intel Deep Learning Essentials（DLE），其中已包含计算运行时和 "
"oneAPI。镜像中的计算运行时版本需要与宿主机的内核驱动兼容，可以通过 ``dpkg -l libze-intel-gpu1`` "
"查看宿主机版本。"
msgstr ""
"The image is based on Intel Deep Learning Essentials (DLE), which already"
" includes the compute runtime and oneAPI. The compute runtime in the "
"image must be compatible with the host's kernel driver; you can check the"
" host version with ``dpkg -l libze-intel-gpu1``."

