"``docker-compose.yml`` 中的 ``group_add`` 使用 ``render`` (992) 和 ``video`` "
"(44) 的数字 GID。如果宿主机不同，请先执行 ``getent group render video`` 查看并修改。"
msgstr ""
"The ``group_add`` entries in ``docker-compose.yml`` use the numeric GIDs "
"of ``render`` (992) and ``video`` (44). If your host differs, run "
"``getent group render video`` and edit them accordingly."

